      "content": "The board is leaning heavily toward the advisory model though. They're worried that without direct human intervention, the fund is becoming too detached from actual market sentiment and potentially too exposed to algorithmic feedback loops. There's a real possibility we'll be phasing out the autonomous execution side entirely by February. Do you think the current alpha targets are sustainable if we hand over the final execution decisions to the management team?",
